WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,650 --> 00:00:08,710
Every time I teleport, I lose a little bit of mental energy.

2
00:00:08,710 --> 00:00:10,710
It turns out that teleportation consumes mental power

3
00:00:10,710 --> 00:00:13,710
In my previous life, I tried my best to move but I could only move a little bit.

4
00:00:13,710 --> 00:00:15,710
I can easily cross three meters

5
00:00:15,710 --> 00:00:17,900
But when it reaches four meters, it becomes stuck.

6
00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:18,900
Can't loosen

7
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:20,900
Don't give up the goal

8
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:29,220
It seems that my mental strength is still too weak.

9
00:00:29,220 --> 00:00:30,220
The limit is only five meters

10
00:00:30,220 --> 00:00:33,140
too weak

11
00:00:33,140 --> 00:00:34,140
Let’s go back and ask the K1 base

12
00:00:34,140 --> 00:00:37,140
If you have any gold boxes that have lost your spiritual system, buy them from them.

13
00:00:37,140 --> 00:00:40,540
Well done

14
00:00:40,540 --> 00:00:41,540
You take it yourself

15
00:00:41,540 --> 00:00:42,540
Drink whatever you want
